abstract: >-
  HCM-364, the Horn Celestial Matrix, is a formal research framework for
  investigating possible relationships among Sabaean-Horn cultural interaction,
  calendrical organization, celestial classification, and observational practice.
  The framework consists of thirteen Houses, seven Gates, and four Elements,
  producing 364 unique coordinates.
